sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Den as Dentist
    actor Adm as SystemAdministrator
    participant Svc as DentistLeaveService
    participant Avail as ClinicalStaffAvailabilityService
    participant Disr as AppointmentDisruptionService
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Den->>Svc: SubmitLeaveRequestAsync(dentistUserId, StartDate, EndDate, StartTime, EndTime, Reason)
    Svc->>Avail: ValidateXrayShiftLeaveCoverageAsync(dentistUserId, dates, times)
    Avail->>DB: Check DentistProfiles.CanPerformXray & remaining on-duty X-ray Dentists per shift
    alt Leave leaves an operational X-ray shift with 0 qualified Dentists
      Avail-->>Svc: Coverage Invalid (0 on-duty X-ray dentists)
      Svc-->>Den: Reject submission (Mandatory rule: >= 1 qualified X-ray dentist per shift)
    else At least 1 qualified X-ray dentist remains (or non-X-ray shift)
      Svc->>DB: INSERT StaffLeaveRequests (Status='Pending')
      DB-->>Den: Leave Request Pending

      Adm->>Svc: GetLeaveImpactAnalysisAsync(leaveRequestId)
      Svc->>DB: Query overlapping AppointmentServices for StaffUserId
      DB-->>Adm: Impact summary (Affected appointments & replacement doctors)

      Adm->>Svc: ApproveLeaveRequestAsync(leaveRequestId, adminUserId)
      Svc->>Avail: Re-verify X-ray shift coverage under transaction lock
      Svc->>DB: UPDATE StaffLeaveRequests SET Status='Approved', ReviewedByUserId=@admin
      Svc->>Disr: FlagAffectedAppointmentsForLeaveAsync(leaveRequest)
      Disr->>DB: UPDATE AppointmentServices SET PendingActionType='Reschedule' (or 'ChangeDentist')
      Disr->>DB: INSERT Notifications (Affected Patients & Receptionists) + AuditLogs
      DB-->>Adm: Leave Approved & Disruption Recovery Triggered
    end